ragnar-desktop (1.0-46) forky; urgency=medium

  * Ragnar-owned GSettings schemas for the settings-daemon keys:
    org.lieraos.ragnar.settings-daemon.plugins.power (screenlock) and
    org.lieraos.ragnar.settings-daemon.plugins.color (nightlight)
    replace the org.gnome.settings-daemon.* schemas, which are only
    shipped by the gnome-settings-daemon package — absent on Liera,
    so ragnar-screenlock hit the fatal "schema not installed" path
    and the idle-lock never came up. screenlock now also opens every
    schema via a lookup guard and falls back to documented defaults
    instead of aborting.

 -- LieraOS Project <projekt@lieraos.local>  Thu, 27 Nov 2025 05:30:00 +0100

ragnar-desktop (1.0-45) forky; urgency=medium

  * new autostart entry grants the local root user access to the
    session display (xhost +SI:localuser:root) — pkexec-launched
    applications like gparted can now open their windows under
    XWayland; Debian ships gparted with its xhost workaround
    disabled, so without this they abort with "cannot open display"

 -- LieraOS Project <projekt@lieraos.local>  Wed, 26 Nov 2025 10:45:00 +0100

ragnar-desktop (1.0-44) forky; urgency=medium

  * labwc-bridge no longer aborts on systems without the mutter /
    settings-daemon gsettings schemas: every schema is looked up
    before use and missing ones leave the affected handler idle
    instead of killing the daemon (SIGABRT on live media)
  * ship ragnar-odin.desktop in wayland-sessions — the greeter now
    offers "Ragnar (Odin, experimental)"; the default session
    stays labwc-based Ragnar, experimental is opt-in only

