 -- LieraOS Project <projekt@lieraos.local>  Sat, 21 Nov 2026 13:00:00 +0100

ragnar-desktop (1.0-40) forky; urgency=medium

  * ragnar-core is now the session bundle: the 17 session-critical
    Rust components (session manager, taskbar, desktop icons, screen
    lock, polkit agent, keyring, display-svc, automount, brightness,
    night-light, OSD, MPRIS, run/power dialogs, gtk3-sync,
    keyboard-layout) are built by debian/stage-components.sh and
    shipped in one package instead of individual .debs
  * Breaks/Replaces/Provides declared for every absorbed package so
    upgrades transition cleanly
  * ragnar-session completed as a drop-in replacement for the old
    gnome-session fork 2.0-7: adds ragnar-session-quit,
    ragnar-session-inhibit and ragnar-session-compositor-ready
    binaries, the launcher wrapper, the user .target unit and the
    SessionManager schema
  * ragnar-desktop becomes the real meta package: Depends on
    ragnar-core, Recommends the optional applications (edit,
    taskmanager, software, settings, screenshot, raven, heimdall,
    skald, wallpaper, backgrounds)
  * Depends cleaned up: component runtime deps (polkitd, gtklock,
    udisks2, pulseaudio-utils, systemd, libglib2.0-bin) now declared
    on the bundle instead of leaking through unrelated packages

 -- LieraOS Project <projekt@lieraos.local>  Sat, 21 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0100

ragnar-desktop (1.0-39) forky; urgency=medium

  * labwc: bind Ctrl+Shift+Esc to ragnar-taskmanager — static bind in
